@model PortalModel
@{ViewData["Title"]="Referral guide";}
<p class="hint">You can share invitations after completing onboarding with an active referral code. No funded file is required. This applies to WhatsApp, LinkedIn, direct referrals, personal links, and QR codes.</p>
<div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Customer-to-Customer REFERRALS</span><h1>A simple introduction.<br/>A shared thank you.</h1><p>A separate referral portal designed around the customer journey.</p></div><button class="button secondary" type="button" data-print>Print this guide</button></div>
<div class="guide-benefits"><div><span>REFERRING CUSTOMER</span><strong>$50 <small>CAD</small></strong><p>For introducing a friend who reaches qualifying funding.</p></div><div><span>NEW CUSTOMER</span><strong>$25 <small>CAD</small></strong><p>For joining through a referral and reaching qualifying funding.</p></div></div>
<section class="panel guide-steps"><article><span class="step-number">01</span><div><h2>Find Refer a Friend</h2><p>Your client portal provides a personal referral link. Copy it or open the WhatsApp / LinkedIn sharing demo.</p></div></article><article><span class="step-number">02</span><div><h2>Make an introduction</h2><p>Compose an invitation. Preview the recipient's message and link, then simulate sending and delivery.</p></div></article><article><span class="step-number">03</span><div><h2>Your friend starts a conversation</h2><p>The referral link opens an enquiry form. Submitted enquiries go to a demo salesperson for follow-up.</p></div></article><article><span class="step-number">04</span><div><h2>Register and reach funding</h2><p>The friend creates an account with your code, completes onboarding and applies. Admin approves the amount and confirms funding separately.</p></div></article><article><span class="step-number">05</span><div><h2>Track the reward</h2><p>Rewards enter review after the first eligible funding. Admin approval and a successful simulated payout are required before a reward is Paid.</p></div></article></section>
<div class="hint"><strong>One sharing code. Many introductions.</strong><p>Each referred profile can attach only one code. Existing customers without an attached code can join; attached codes cannot be replaced. No self-referral or retroactive reward for earlier funding. One reward pair per referred customer.</p><p>All messaging, salesperson follow-up and payments are simulated. The $50 / $25 rewards are illustrative demo values, not an approved HomeEquity Bank offer.</p></div>
